{"id": "waiver-reports-not-filed", "title": "Waivers promised the Board donor reports; 8 of 15 now due are not on record", "seconds": 130.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "tempo": 1.139, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "fad4c71dcd7cb4d8", "words": 387, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "Since February 14, 2025, every waiver the Board of Supervisors grants has carried a promise.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.14, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "Waiver resolutions, from 14 February 2025", "text": "Each promises the Board a report of donations solicited from interested parties.", "mark": "a report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.73, 1.31, 1.63, 2.44, 2.83, 3.24, 3.34, 3.57, 3.67, 4.34, 4.77, 4.96, 5.27, 5.33]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]", "established[4]"], "text": "A report back to the Board, of donations asked from interested parties.", "t0": 6.26, "t1": 9.95, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "Waiver resolutions, from 14 February 2025", "text": "Each promises the Board a report of donations solicited from interested parties.", "mark": "a report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.53, 0.76, 0.84, 0.92, 1.33, 1.46, 2.11, 2.47, 2.67, 3.13]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "By 20 November 2026, 15 of those reports were due. How many are in the files?", "t0": 10.07, "t1": 15.3, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["reports due by 20 November 2026", "15"], "b": ["reports attached to a Board file", "how many?"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.47, 0.87, 1.16, 1.8, 2.28, 2.36, 2.58, 2.96, 3.11, 3.84, 4.04, 4.26, 4.34, 4.4, 4.48]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]", "amount"], "text": "5.", "t0": 15.3, "t1": 15.81, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "5", "label": "reports attached to the Board files", "sub": "of 15 due"}, "emph": ["5"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat", "innocent[0]"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding. A missing report may sit with the Clerk.", "t0": 16.33, "t1": 20.22, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.32, 0.4, 0.85, 1.06, 1.14, 2.05, 2.22, 2.53, 2.92, 3.11, 3.33, 3.45, 3.53]}, {"scene": "how", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Officials may not ask people with business before them for donations.", "t0": 20.44, "t1": 23.85, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "grants a waiver"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Officials named in it", "sub": "may ask for donations"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Interested parties", "sub": "people with business before them"}], "kicker": "How a waiver works"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.7, 0.89, 1.13, 1.41, 1.57, 1.97, 2.28, 2.46, 2.61]}, {"scene": "how", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "Unless the Board grants a waiver. Since 2023, it has granted 29.", "t0": 23.97, "t1": 28.66, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "grants a waiver"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Officials named in it", "sub": "may ask for donations"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Interested parties", "sub": "people with business before them"}], "kicker": "How a waiver works"}, "emph": ["29"], "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.52, 0.82, 1.16, 1.23, 2.12, 2.45, 2.75, 3.39, 3.53, 3.66, 4.0]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "Eight past due are not on record. Three more reached the Clerk, and are now read.", "t0": 28.88, "t1": 33.27, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Due, with no report attached", "rows": [["Resolution 080-25", "first due about 2025-04-07"], ["Resolution 056-25", "due 2025-10-13"], ["Resolution 134-25", "due 2025-12-14"], ["Resolution 261-25", "due 2026-01-28"], ["Resolution 424-25", "due 2026-05-17"], ["and 3 more", "due 2026"]]}, "emph": ["Eight"], "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.61, 0.86, 1.01, 1.21, 1.33, 2.12, 2.46, 2.72, 3.02, 3.12, 3.5, 3.68, 3.83, 4.05]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[9]"], "text": "Officials who are not elected file no Form 803, Ethics staff note.", "t0": 33.39, "t1": 37.68, "shot": "b6y", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the report matters most for officials who are not elected, because they file no Form 803"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.62, 0.77, 0.91, 1.26, 1.6, 1.81, 2.16, 2.4, 2.72, 3.2, 3.57, 3.96]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "timeline[4]"], "text": "Then India Basin. Recreation and Park’s report was due December 14, 2025.", "t0": 37.9, "t1": 43.44, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2025-12-03", "to": "2025-12-23", "days": "20", "fromLab": "report “in progress”", "toLab": "next India Basin waiver granted", "kicker": "Recreation and Park, India Basin"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.54, 1.78, 2.36, 2.47, 2.8, 3.18, 3.36, 3.54, 3.94, 4.56, 4.9]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "On December 3, the department wrote that it was in progress.", "t0": 43.56, "t1": 46.38, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2025-12-03", "to": "2025-12-23", "days": "20", "fromLab": "report “in progress”", "toLab": "next India Basin waiver granted", "kicker": "Recreation and Park, India Basin"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.61, 0.89, 0.99, 1.44, 1.69, 1.81, 1.87, 2.0, 2.11]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "timeline[14]"], "text": "On December 16, the Board voted the next India Basin waiver.", "t0": 46.5, "t1": 50.0, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2025-12-03", "to": "2025-12-16", "days": "13", "fromLab": "report “in progress”", "toLab": "next India Basin waiver adopted", "kicker": "Recreation and Park, India Basin"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.58, 1.24, 1.37, 1.64, 1.93, 2.03, 2.34, 2.67, 3.05]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "No report is attached to either file.", "t0": 50.12, "t1": 52.05, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "no report is attached to either file"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.6, 0.73, 1.11, 1.21, 1.5]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "But the Board’s packet held the department’s answers: one interested party asked, Lyft.", "t0": 52.47, "t1": 57.97, "shot": "b9a", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the one interested party solicited under Resolution 134-25 was Lyft"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.23, 0.6, 1.06, 1.29, 1.39, 1.93, 3.14, 3.42, 3.9, 4.28, 4.97]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "What do the five reports on file say? Three say no interested party was asked.", "t0": 58.19, "t1": 62.56, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "The 5 reports on file", "kicker": "What they say"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.26, 0.34, 0.59, 0.96, 1.1, 1.44, 2.18, 2.53, 2.8, 3.02, 3.4, 3.69, 3.85]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[0]", "timeline[8]"], "text": "Two name donors. Google, through Fidelity Charitable, gave 1,000,000 dollars.", "t0": 62.68, "t1": 67.25, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Fidelity Charitable Perspectives (Google)", "$1,000,000.00"], "b": ["The Prado Group, Inc.", "$51,000.00"]}, "emph": ["1,000,000"], "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.51, 1.36, 1.81, 2.06, 2.5, 3.0, 3.2, 3.47, 3.67, 4.01]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "timeline[13]"], "text": "The Prado Group gave 51,000, for the Downtown Development Corp.", "t0": 67.37, "t1": 71.08, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Fidelity Charitable Perspectives (Google)", "$1,000,000.00"], "b": ["The Prado Group, Inc.", "$51,000.00"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.49, 0.77, 1.0, 2.14, 2.3, 2.4, 2.88, 3.35]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[6]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The three at the Clerk add Crankstart: 10 million dollars, solicited by the Mayor’s Office.", "t0": 71.2, "t1": 75.81, "shot": "b14a", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "c6q1", "kicker": "Homelessness department report, Resolution 126-25", "text": "Crankstart, $10,000,000, for Breaking the Cycle: solicited by the Mayor’s Office, interested party “Yes”", "mark": "$10,000,000"}, "emph": ["10 million dollars"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.37, 0.48, 0.58, 0.92, 1.18, 2.03, 2.33, 2.67, 3.03, 3.52, 3.65, 3.74, 4.1]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "established[6]"], "text": "Yet the Mayor’s reports for those months say no interested party was solicited.", "t0": 75.93, "t1": 79.82, "shot": "b14b", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Homelessness department’s report", "Crankstart: an interested party, solicited by the Mayor’s Office"], "b": ["The Mayor’s reports, same months", "no interested party solicited"], "arrows": false}, "emph": ["no interested party"], "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.28, 0.64, 1.09, 1.25, 1.51, 1.85, 2.11, 2.34, 2.82, 3.13, 3.28]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[7]", "suspicious[2]", "links[4]"], "text": "Five interested-party donors in all: 11,813,841 dollars.", "t0": 80.34, "t1": 84.43, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Interested-party donors on record", "rows": [["Crankstart", "$10,000,000"], ["Fidelity Charitable Perspectives (Google)", "$1,000,000"], ["Tipping Point Community", "$469,591"], ["San Francisco Housing Accelerator Fund", "$293,250"], ["The Prado Group, Inc.", "$51,000"]]}, "emph": ["11,813,841"], "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 1.18, 1.56, 1.67, 2.08, 2.36, 2.69, 2.96, 3.19, 3.54]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "links[5]"], "text": "The waiver papers name 70 organizations. 32 share a name with City payees.", "t0": 84.65, "t1": 89.69, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "70", "label": "organizations named in the waiver papers", "sub": "32 carry the same or a similar name as a City payee"}, "emph": ["32"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.46, 0.86, 1.1, 1.54, 2.9, 3.53, 3.77, 3.84, 4.04, 4.18, 4.46]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "The records do not show whether each is the same organization.", "t0": 89.81, "t1": 92.83, "shot": "b15a", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the match is on the name alone"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.52, 0.68, 0.88, 1.14, 1.43, 1.66, 1.8, 1.91, 2.18]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "The homelessness department’s memo lists the San Francisco Housing Accelerator Fund among interested parties.", "t0": 92.95, "t1": 98.41, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "San Francisco Housing Accelerator Fund", "kicker": "An interested party, says the memo", "chip": "$55.9 million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.67, 1.18, 1.58, 1.88, 1.98, 2.21, 2.73, 3.11, 3.73, 4.06, 4.4, 4.88]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "The City has paid that fund 55.9 million dollars since 2019.", "t0": 98.53, "t1": 102.77, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "San Francisco Housing Accelerator Fund", "kicker": "An interested party, says the memo", "chip": "$55.9 million"}, "emph": ["55.9 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.37, 0.5, 0.73, 0.92, 1.24, 1.86, 2.13, 2.38, 2.7, 3.06, 3.32, 3.64]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "Larkin Street Youth Services, also named, was paid 119.6 million dollars by two departments.", "t0": 102.89, "t1": 109.26, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Larkin Street Youth Services", "sub": "$105.7 million from the homelessness department, $13.9 million from the Mayor’s departments", "chip": "$119.6 million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.75, 1.02, 1.66, 2.09, 2.51, 2.72, 2.97, 3.17, 3.52, 3.95, 4.23, 4.53, 4.89, 5.3, 5.45, 5.65]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "innocent[1]"], "text": "Being named in the papers is not being asked for money.", "t0": 109.38, "t1": 111.83, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Being named is not being asked."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.53, 0.61, 0.7, 1.09, 1.23, 1.4, 1.62, 1.92, 2.09]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Not shown: that any report was never made, or who gave under the missing ones.", "t0": 112.05, "t1": 116.23, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any report was never made", "Who gave under the waivers whose reports are missing", "That any donation was given in return for a decision"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.79, 1.01, 1.24, 1.63, 1.78, 2.04, 2.41, 2.59, 2.75, 3.02, 3.25, 3.33, 3.67]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Or that any gift bought a decision.", "t0": 116.35, "t1": 118.11, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any report was never made", "Who gave under the waivers whose reports are missing", "That any donation was given in return for a decision"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.32, 0.53, 0.84, 1.1, 1.18]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The Clerk’s log for each file, and each office’s donor list.", "t0": 118.23, "t1": 123.0, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The Clerk of the Board’s communications log for each file"}, {"who": "", "what": "Each office’s donor list under each waiver"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.3, 0.63, 1.36, 1.53, 1.88, 2.17, 2.34, 2.58, 3.04, 3.24, 3.53, 4.04, 4.37]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "defense[0]"], "text": "No regulator or court has ruled on this. Nobody named here was asked for comment.", "t0": 123.12, "t1": 127.32, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.81, 0.98, 1.28, 1.43, 1.73, 1.85, 2.3, 2.68, 2.95, 3.11, 3.3, 3.56, 3.7]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.44, "t1": 129.46, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.4, 0.5, 0.56, 1.01, 1.19, 1.28]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "A promise", "how": "How a waiver works", "lead1": "Lead 1 · ten reports missing", "lead2": "Lead 2 · renewed without a report", "lead3": "Lead 3 · two donors named", "lead4": "Lead 4 · who is named", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "kinetic", "hook": "contrast"}